# bitGen Studio — line endings (2.591.3). Windows' cmd needs CRLF in a .bat / .cmd (with LF a label or a goto can be
# misread), so every checkout - Windows, Linux, GitHub's CI - gets them with CRLF, whatever the committing git's
# core.autocrlf did to them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# 2.616.0: install_all.bat is downloaded on its own too (GitHub's raw file) - kept with CRLF in the repo itself
install_all.bat -text
